5d9b9.poster.avif?t=1706586860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781960/extras/03767227d61282660ed1814aaf75d9b9.webm?t=1706586860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781960/extras/03767227d61282660ed1814aaf75d9b9.mp4?t=1706586860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your own path towards the Sigil</h2>Make your way through 3 dynamic worlds full of fateful choices hidden secrets and face challenging bosses at the end of each journey. Choose your path wisely and your party will thrive, not just survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781960/extras/0c6c7059546944c764faf0357870ce3d.avif?t=1706586860\" /></div>",
